---
// About us — full-bleed Ripple Yellow. Mirrors the deck's editorial
// "Our Approach" slides (slide 2: "We are operators first..."), with
// the manifesto paragraphs from slides 6 and 25.
---

<section id="about" class="bg-ripple-yellow text-ripple-black">
  <div class="section">
    <div class="section-inner grid lg:grid-cols-12 gap-12 lg:gap-20">
      <!-- Section label -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-4">
        <span class="eyebrow">About us</span>
        <div class="mt-6 lg:sticky lg:top-32">
          <p class="font-mono text-sm leading-relaxed text-ripple-black/80 max-w-xs">
            RippleHouse exists for brands — and the people behind them — who
            want to scale with intention and create meaningful impact.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Manifesto -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-8 space-y-12">
        <h2 class="text-display-lg">
          We are operators first &mdash; not just advisors.
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-8 text-lg md:text-xl leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
          <p>
            Most brands don't fail because of product. They fail because they
            can't scale correctly. Growth exposes every weakness in a business
            &mdash; strategy gaps, operational strain, weak margins, misaligned
            partnerships, poor retail execution and cultural cracks.
          </p>
          <p>
            We understand that reality because we've lived it &mdash;
            together, we can solve this problem. Our founder-to-founder
            methodology is built on experience, precision, and execution.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Three beliefs from slide 6 -->
        <div class="border-t-2 border-ripple-black/15 pt-10 max-w-3xl">
          <h3 class="text-display-sm mb-8">
            Profitable growth comes first. Impact follows &mdash; and lasts.
          </h3>

          <ul class="space-y-5 text-base md:text-lg">
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 inline-block w-6 h-[2px] bg-ripple-black flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <span>In alignment with your values.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 inline-block w-6 h-[2px] bg-ripple-black flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <span>In respect of the eco-system you operate in.</span>
            </li>
            <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
              <span aria-hidden="true" class="mt-2 inline-block w-6 h-[2px] bg-ripple-black flex-shrink-0"></span>
              <span>In collaboration with the people who make your brand possible.</span>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <p class="mt-8 font-display text-xl md:text-2xl font-extrabold">
            Growth first. Impact that lasts.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
